# This repo is edited on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) but everything below runs
# on Linux: bash scripts on the EC2 instance and in CI, and Terraform embeds
# infra/scripts/* into the instance's user-data. A CRLF `#!/bin/bash\r` fails
# with "bad interpreter", so force LF in the working copy too, not just in the
# repository.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.tftpl       text eol=lf
*.cron        text eol=lf
infra/scripts/* text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
*.tf          text eol=lf
